config BR2_PACKAGE_WAYPOINT_RESIZE
    bool "waypoint-resize"
    default y
    help
      First-boot oneshot that grows the trailing "store" partition
      (PARTUUID eeee..., mounted at /data/waypoint/store) to fill the
      whole SD card, then grows its ext4 filesystem online. Idempotent
      via a sentinel on /data; wiping /data re-arms it. Runs before
      waypoint-agent/waypoint-core. Needs sgdisk (gptfdisk), partx
      (util-linux), and resize2fs (e2fsprogs) on the target.
